# cyto genome exported from cell 3 — load it via Load Genome (rename to cyto-brush.gene).
Break gg : Biomass < 4000 : Convert gg @15
Light : 0 < 1984 : FormBond g g
Break gg : rg < r & rg < 4000 & rr < 4220 : FormBond r r @15
Break rr : r < rr & r < 4000 : FormBond r g @15
Break rg : rr < rg & rr < 4800 : Contract @6
